(6218913, 918409, 83313, '<td valign="top">I just about spit up on my monitor. You are the <strike>kind</strike> king of gross, Slippy! Nice teef as well. Gotta give this a high vote and a fave. If the rest of the crowd appreciates it half as much as I do, then you''ll end up with, er,... well, um, ...just a hair over 5.0.<br/> <br/>Edit to correct my phat phingering.</td>', 'I just about spit up on my monitor. You are the kind king of gross, Slippy! Nice teef as well. Gotta give this a high vote and a fave. If the rest of the crowd appreciates it half as much as I do, then you''ll end up with, er,... well, um, ...just a hair over 5.0. Edit to correct my phat phingering.', '2010-11-10 13:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6219111, 918668, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like the story told, the expressions and all. The one thing that bothers me is that the background. The background color shading is different in each of the frames, breaking the story line. The lighting on the first image also seems a bit harsher than the other two. Still good effort and thought. Focus is good too.</td>', 'I like the story told, the expressions and all. The one thing that bothers me is that the background. The background color shading is different in each of the frames, breaking the story line. The lighting on the first image also seems a bit harsher than the other two. Still good effort and thought. Focus is good too.', '2010-11-10 16:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6219115, 918600, 37252, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a but soft. Lighting is inconsistent thus breaking the story line. Too much border. Not horrible, but just average to my eye.</td>', 'Focus seems a but soft. Lighting is inconsistent thus breaking the story line. Too much border. Not horrible, but just average to my eye.', '2010-11-10 16:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6219117, 918470, 37252, '<td valign="top">I think you captured well the story you are photographing. I love that you kept the lighting uniform and consistent throughout.</td>', 'I think you captured well the story you are photographing. I love that you kept the lighting uniform and consistent throughout.', '2010-11-10 16:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6219119, 918092, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice actions series. I feel the odd scrapbook style edges to the image, and the heavy black outer border are too much though. It makes the image look less clean and professional.</td>', 'Nice actions series. I feel the odd scrapbook style edges to the image, and the heavy black outer border are too much though. It makes the image look less clean and professional.', '2010-11-10 16:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6219122, 918612, 37252, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. I love how the side images a ''chapters'' and the middle is the complete work. Nice sepia tone too.</td>', 'Beautifully done. I love how the side images a ''chapters'' and the middle is the complete work. Nice sepia tone too.', '2010-11-10 16:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6219124, 918695, 37252, '<td valign="top">Harsh lighting on the foreground of first image. Banding in the sky on the second. Inconsistent exposures throughout. Funny story</td>', 'Harsh lighting on the foreground of first image. Banding in the sky on the second. Inconsistent exposures throughout. Funny story', '2010-11-10 16:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6219128, 918005, 37252, '<td valign="top">Excellent! An image I might expect to see in a makeup / styling ad. Love the soft glow.</td>', 'Excellent! An image I might expect to see in a makeup / styling ad. Love the soft glow.', '2010-11-10 16:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6219133, 918447, 37252, '<td valign="top">Interesting story. Shadows might be a little hard. I really wish the foot had not been cropped off in the middle image. The first image seems a bit awkward for the model. Still, I like the story and the color tones.</td>', 'Interesting story. Shadows might be a little hard. I really wish the foot had not been cropped off in the middle image. The first image seems a bit awkward for the model. Still, I like the story and the color tones.', '2010-11-10 16:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6219135, 918349, 37252, '<td valign="top">Usually I hate seeing entries of toys. However, it is very fitting here and well executed. Great job on the lighting. Focus on the first image seems a little too soft, but over all this is well done.</td>', 'Usually I hate seeing entries of toys. However, it is very fitting here and well executed. Great job on the lighting. Focus on the first image seems a little too soft, but over all this is well done.', '2010-11-10 16:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
