(6220113, 918738, 72670, '<td valign="top">Pics are crisp. Borders are a little uneven and the top left pic is a little higher than the main pic. Bottom left pic looks a little funny with his dopey eyes.</td>', 'Pics are crisp. Borders are a little uneven and the top left pic is a little higher than the main pic. Bottom left pic looks a little funny with his dopey eyes.', '2010-11-11 14:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220114, 918235, 72670, '<td valign="top">I say go with the third set. A little levels boost would help this set. Good luck</td>', 'I say go with the third set. A little levels boost would help this set. Good luck', '2010-11-11 14:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220116, 918646, 67258, '<td valign="top">Superb.  back to bump to a 10.</td>', 'Superb.  back to bump to a 10.', '2010-11-11 14:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220118, 918665, 72670, '<td valign="top">There are several entries with a series of progression like this one. I feel that in this situation the lighting should be identical throughout the series. The lighting in the middle pic is brighter and better than the 2 shots on the ends. Also a hair light in the top right pointing down at your subject would give it more shape and hilite his hair. I still like the story</td>', 'There are several entries with a series of progression like this one. I feel that in this situation the lighting should be identical throughout the series. The lighting in the middle pic is brighter and better than the 2 shots on the ends. Also a hair light in the top right pointing down at your subject would give it more shape and hilite his hair. I still like the story', '2010-11-11 14:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220119, 918733, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful piece of work here. Such a creative idea. Extremely well executed. Lighting is perfect, tones are lovely. Top notch.</td>', 'Wonderful piece of work here. Such a creative idea. Extremely well executed. Lighting is perfect, tones are lovely. Top notch.', '2010-11-11 14:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220199, 918122, 72670, '<td valign="top">The first 2 pics are great! You lose me on the third. The real umbrella gets lost in the background and loses effect. You should have kept the drawn umbrella with the cats and dogs. IMO</td>', 'The first 2 pics are great! You lose me on the third. The real umbrella gets lost in the background and loses effect. You should have kept the drawn umbrella with the cats and dogs. IMO', '2010-11-11 16:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220200, 918680, 72670, '<td valign="top">Slightly off on the 2 end pics, but still a good series. Nice expression!</td>', 'Slightly off on the 2 end pics, but still a good series. Nice expression!', '2010-11-11 16:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220202, 917799, 72670, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to make of this. I like the shots, the presentation, everything is good. I think the second pic and how I t ties in with your series is throwing me off. 7</td>', 'Not sure what to make of this. I like the shots, the presentation, everything is good. I think the second pic and how I t ties in with your series is throwing me off. 7', '2010-11-11 16:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220203, 918409, 72670, '<td valign="top">Sublime!</td>', 'Sublime!', '2010-11-11 16:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220208, 918724, 72670, '<td valign="top">Great series and dramatic middle pic. The stray <strike>antennae</strike> hair on  the end pics should have been cloned out.7</td>', 'Great series and dramatic middle pic. The stray antennae hair on  the end pics should have been cloned out.7', '2010-11-11 16:38:24.000000', NULL, 1);
