(6220230, 918716, 72670, '<td valign="top">The whole retro look for me is hit or miss. Unfortunately this is a little miss. The vibrant colours in the scarf are sort of contradictory with the finish you applied. I think the colours should have popped off the page. This just is a little dull. IMO</td>', 'The whole retro look for me is hit or miss. Unfortunately this is a little miss. The vibrant colours in the scarf are sort of contradictory with the finish you applied. I think the colours should have popped off the page. This just is a little dull. IMO', '2010-11-11 16:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
