(6220421, 918609, 33535, '<td valign="top">the tonemapping master strikes again!<br/>nice metamorphosis to show what a bit of digital processing skills can do to a face.</td>', 'the tonemapping master strikes again!nice metamorphosis to show what a bit of digital processing skills can do to a face.', '2010-11-11 20:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220432, 918516, 33535, '<td valign="top">...and still can''t stop watching...! ;)<br/>nice and funny take on the three wise monkeys theme!</td>', '...and still can''t stop watching...! ;)nice and funny take on the three wise monkeys theme!', '2010-11-11 20:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220438, 918210, 33535, '<td valign="top">like three movie stills from a sequence of different angles.<br/>good combination of images, and even though the processing is really harsh i think it fits with the message of the series.</td>', 'like three movie stills from a sequence of different angles.good combination of images, and even though the processing is really harsh i think it fits with the message of the series.', '2010-11-11 20:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220442, 918447, 33535, '<td valign="top">good images, but give your model more space and don''t cut off any body parts!<br/>especially the third frame really unbalances the composition.<br/>this would have looked good in b&amp;w me thinks...<br/>btw, you (and your model) forgot about a very important part that makes dancing a kind of art: emotion and expression. though i suspect that part comes with having music and the actual space to move freely...;)</td>', 'good images, but give your model more space and don''t cut off any body parts!especially the third frame really unbalances the composition.this would have looked good in b&w me thinks...btw, you (and your model) forgot about a very important part that makes dancing a kind of art: emotion and expression. though i suspect that part comes with having music and the actual space to move freely...;)', '2010-11-11 20:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220448, 918535, 33535, '<td valign="top">[thought balloon]hey, what does that guy want from me again. he''s got this weird plastic thing pointing at me but doesn''t give me any food. [yawn] i could as well just have another nap then. rrrrrzzzzzz...</td>', '[thought balloon]hey, what does that guy want from me again. he''s got this weird plastic thing pointing at me but doesn''t give me any food. [yawn] i could as well just have another nap then. rrrrrzzzzzz...', '2010-11-11 20:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
