(6220462, 918369, 33535, '<td valign="top">sometimes hands can portray a person in a more honest way than eyes do.<br/>eyes can lie, hands can''t.<br/>she seems to be very talented, and so is the photographer!</td>', 'sometimes hands can portray a person in a more honest way than eyes do.eyes can lie, hands can''t.she seems to be very talented, and so is the photographer!', '2010-11-11 20:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
