(6220467, 917916, 33535, '<td valign="top">interesting interpretation of the pop art theme. ;)<br/>this made me smile!</td>', 'interesting interpretation of the pop art theme. ;)this made me smile!', '2010-11-11 20:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220468, 918727, 33535, '<td valign="top">she''s gonna be a good boogaloo dancer (or an actress)!<br/>cute series.</td>', 'she''s gonna be a good boogaloo dancer (or an actress)!cute series.', '2010-11-11 20:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220474, 918005, 33535, '<td valign="top">i love the single frames, but the way you combined them takes away from the overall "impact" imo. a "traditional" horizontal (or in this case, vertical) arrangement would have worked better.<br/>i don''t like the way her right lashes are scrammed inbetween the smaller frames in the bigger background photo.<br/>still a good series!<br/> <br/>(not voting)</td>', 'i love the single frames, but the way you combined them takes away from the overall "impact" imo. a "traditional" horizontal (or in this case, vertical) arrangement would have worked better.i don''t like the way her right lashes are scrammed inbetween the smaller frames in the bigger background photo.still a good series! (not voting)', '2010-11-11 21:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220485, 918662, 33535, '<td valign="top">ha, that guy lived in the same city as i do right now!<br/>i love photos that make me do a little research on the "content" or interpretation. <br/>good abstract-emotional images!</td>', 'ha, that guy lived in the same city as i do right now!i love photos that make me do a little research on the "content" or interpretation. good abstract-emotional images!', '2010-11-11 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
