(6220520, 917968, 33535, '<td valign="top">reminds me of the times when my sister used to bath with me...a loooong time ago. ;)<br/>nice comp, but i especially love the bottom frame. i think it could have been improved if you had taken close up "straight on" portraits (NOT from above) of the kids for the upper frames and combined them with the bottom frame which then provides a different angle and lets the viewer be part of the action.<br/> <br/>(not voting)</td>', 'reminds me of the times when my sister used to bath with me...a loooong time ago. ;)nice comp, but i especially love the bottom frame. i think it could have been improved if you had taken close up "straight on" portraits (NOT from above) of the kids for the upper frames and combined them with the bottom frame which then provides a different angle and lets the viewer be part of the action. (not voting)', '2010-11-11 21:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220538, 918470, 77196, '<td valign="top">She''s adorable. Two of my three children have autism - one boy and one girl. Best to you.</td>', 'She''s adorable. Two of my three children have autism - one boy and one girl. Best to you.', '2010-11-11 22:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220548, 918735, 77196, '<td valign="top">IMO, this is too far from the subject, and the similar pillar at the center left &amp; right edge not matching up height-wise I find quite distracting. There is also a different tone (almost greenish / cyanish) in the right portrait that is not present in the other two. It also looks like you''ve used on-the-camera flash, creating harsh shadows from the bride &amp; left pillar. This is a great memory picture, showing nice detail in the full dress. However, this is a difficult triptych to get right, and there is quite a bit that could have been done in pp to improve the final result.</td>', 'IMO, this is too far from the subject, and the similar pillar at the center left & right edge not matching up height-wise I find quite distracting. There is also a different tone (almost greenish / cyanish) in the right portrait that is not present in the other two. It also looks like you''ve used on-the-camera flash, creating harsh shadows from the bride & left pillar. This is a great memory picture, showing nice detail in the full dress. However, this is a difficult triptych to get right, and there is quite a bit that could have been done in pp to improve the final result.', '2010-11-11 22:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220549, 918669, 77196, '<td valign="top">IMO, the person is too far away. It feels to me like a much closer crop would have conveyed the story just as well, and been much more interesting.</td>', 'IMO, the person is too far away. It feels to me like a much closer crop would have conveyed the story just as well, and been much more interesting.', '2010-11-11 22:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220550, 918600, 77196, '<td valign="top">A bit too much border for my taste...</td>', 'A bit too much border for my taste...', '2010-11-11 22:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220551, 918695, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute concept. Colors looks overdone - especially the green vegetation. Watch the backgrounds - the phone poles &amp; wires in the background of the left two shots are distracting.</td>', 'Cute concept. Colors looks overdone - especially the green vegetation. Watch the backgrounds - the phone poles & wires in the background of the left two shots are distracting.', '2010-11-11 22:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220552, 918574, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. Well done.</td>', 'Nice concept. Well done.', '2010-11-11 22:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6220555, 918716, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the colors &amp; the model - not sure about the ear muffs. IMO, there''s something wrong in the exposure / focus / lighting - the images look slightly OOF, combined with a light tinge.</td>', 'Love the colors & the model - not sure about the ear muffs. IMO, there''s something wrong in the exposure / focus / lighting - the images look slightly OOF, combined with a light tinge.', '2010-11-11 22:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
