(6220720, 918646, 53147, '<td valign="top">Yeah - this is surely the winner. Great light work, prefect layout and surely tells a story of the individual. My only nitpick is with the runner. Splashing water on the swimmer makes total sense. The water on the bicyclist looks like sweat blowing off of him and fits. I am not getting the water on the runner. Looks cool from a visual perspective - but as far as how it relates to the story I am not sure. Did someone dump a gatorade bucket on him as he was running by? Didnt impact my vote in anyway, but figuring that this image is soaring in score I thought I would go ahead and throw out the one issue I had with it.</td>', 'Yeah - this is surely the winner. Great light work, prefect layout and surely tells a story of the individual. My only nitpick is with the runner. Splashing water on the swimmer makes total sense. The water on the bicyclist looks like sweat blowing off of him and fits. I am not getting the water on the runner. Looks cool from a visual perspective - but as far as how it relates to the story I am not sure. Did someone dump a gatorade bucket on him as he was running by? Didnt impact my vote in anyway, but figuring that this image is soaring in score I thought I would go ahead and throw out the one issue I had with it.', '2010-11-12 07:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
