(6222098, 918094, 67237, '<td valign="top">Nice expression and pose in photo 1 (left)<br/>I assume the intention was to show the subject "in action", but camera angle and composition in photos 2 and 3 are not doing the job. Side and back takes are difficult. <br/>It would have been great if at least one of the photos shows the face and a relevant "painting" element, such as the canvas or the brush to convey pictures of a painter....6</td>', 'Nice expression and pose in photo 1 (left)I assume the intention was to show the subject "in action", but camera angle and composition in photos 2 and 3 are not doing the job. Side and back takes are difficult. It would have been great if at least one of the photos shows the face and a relevant "painting" element, such as the canvas or the brush to convey pictures of a painter....6', '2010-11-14 12:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
