(6222218, 918760, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea, background coloring, clarity, and first two photos. The black tape in the third photo is really throwing me off. I think it''s because it''s so large, and thus covering too much of the face in my opinion.</td>', 'I really like the idea, background coloring, clarity, and first two photos. The black tape in the third photo is really throwing me off. I think it''s because it''s so large, and thus covering too much of the face in my opinion.', '2010-11-14 14:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
