(6222288, 918716, 122131, '<td valign="top">I really like this -- I like the muted colours, her face expressions, the dreamy feel of it..<br/>I really don''t get the ear-muffs though. They seem a bit distracting for me.<br/>And the socks (appear) to be worn on the toes.. <br/>Of course, I could be completely wrong.<br/>I will give you the benefit of the doubt, as it''s such an appealing image, and I hope you do well.<br/>8.</td>', 'I really like this -- I like the muted colours, her face expressions, the dreamy feel of it..I really don''t get the ear-muffs though. They seem a bit distracting for me.And the socks (appear) to be worn on the toes.. Of course, I could be completely wrong.I will give you the benefit of the doubt, as it''s such an appealing image, and I hope you do well.8.', '2010-11-14 17:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
