(6222397, 918745, 108069, '<td valign="top">Outrageously funny. What a wonderful idea and I hope you had as much fun making this as it seems. Awesome.</td>', 'Outrageously funny. What a wonderful idea and I hope you had as much fun making this as it seems. Awesome.', '2010-11-14 18:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222399, 917968, 108069, '<td valign="top">AWESOME. Love the huge size as well. What a wonderful scene. Top marks.</td>', 'AWESOME. Love the huge size as well. What a wonderful scene. Top marks.', '2010-11-14 18:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222401, 918680, 108069, '<td valign="top">Hilarious. You must be from the midwest. Excellent scene, great stuff.</td>', 'Hilarious. You must be from the midwest. Excellent scene, great stuff.', '2010-11-14 18:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222402, 918621, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Very well done. Nice work.</td>', 'Very cute. Very well done. Nice work.', '2010-11-14 18:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222405, 918646, 108069, '<td valign="top">There were truly a ton of amazing efforts in this challenge. The creativity really shined, and the execution was also incredibly impressive. But I have to say this is the best of the lot. To tie the triathlon into a triptych is either close to the heart or a stroke of genius. Quite possibly both.<br/> <br/>Beyond that your photos are captivating and ridiculously well lit. And the layout is refreshing as well. Outstanding work. Truly excellent. 10, and my favorite.</td>', 'There were truly a ton of amazing efforts in this challenge. The creativity really shined, and the execution was also incredibly impressive. But I have to say this is the best of the lot. To tie the triathlon into a triptych is either close to the heart or a stroke of genius. Quite possibly both. Beyond that your photos are captivating and ridiculously well lit. And the layout is refreshing as well. Outstanding work. Truly excellent. 10, and my favorite.', '2010-11-14 18:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222406, 918122, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very clever. Cute story as well. Very well done.</td>', 'Very clever. Cute story as well. Very well done.', '2010-11-14 18:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222413, 917780, 108069, '<td valign="top">This was the one that jumped out at me the first seven times I went through the photos in this challenge. Sadly, I only voted it a 9 because I thought a 10 might be biased because I recognize you and love your work and etc. But now that I''ve finished voting and am looking at the tiers of photos, this does not in any way belong in the 9s. It''s a truly beautiful piece of work. Classy, sincere, a timeless memory for your family. Outstanding. 10, of course.</td>', 'This was the one that jumped out at me the first seven times I went through the photos in this challenge. Sadly, I only voted it a 9 because I thought a 10 might be biased because I recognize you and love your work and etc. But now that I''ve finished voting and am looking at the tiers of photos, this does not in any way belong in the 9s. It''s a truly beautiful piece of work. Classy, sincere, a timeless memory for your family. Outstanding. 10, of course.', '2010-11-14 18:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222461, 918122, 4767, '<td valign="top">interesting concept.</td>', 'interesting concept.', '2010-11-14 19:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
