(6222606, 918709, 24511, '<td valign="top">At first I was going to give a 3 but noticed the excellent framing (I can''t find anything on my Elements 7 to combine the three photos for the challenge).  What really got to me was the sensation of wanting to vomit.  Crisp image and extracting gut wrenching emotion raised your caption to my top score so far.  Good luck 6.</td>', 'At first I was going to give a 3 but noticed the excellent framing (I can''t find anything on my Elements 7 to combine the three photos for the challenge).  What really got to me was the sensation of wanting to vomit.  Crisp image and extracting gut wrenching emotion raised your caption to my top score so far.  Good luck 6.', '2010-11-14 22:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222607, 918761, 24511, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a Harry Potter movie trailer.  Would have given more points for clarity on both images to the right.  Wide angle framing very narrow for my taste.  Thanks.</td>', 'Reminds me of a Harry Potter movie trailer.  Would have given more points for clarity on both images to the right.  Wide angle framing very narrow for my taste.  Thanks.', '2010-11-14 22:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
