(6222609, 918651, 24511, '<td valign="top">Hate the framing but loved the faces.  Second top score so far in my voting.  Good luck 6.</td>', 'Hate the framing but loved the faces.  Second top score so far in my voting.  Good luck 6.', '2010-11-14 22:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222610, 918612, 24511, '<td valign="top">Nice bookend effect but I found the whole seemed like a one grouping of horses instead of the telling of a story.  Love horses and calming climat of the photos.  Raising to 6 even though I didn''t enjoy the spiting portraits left and right captions.  Thanks.</td>', 'Nice bookend effect but I found the whole seemed like a one grouping of horses instead of the telling of a story.  Love horses and calming climat of the photos.  Raising to 6 even though I didn''t enjoy the spiting portraits left and right captions.  Thanks.', '2010-11-14 22:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222614, 918724, 24511, '<td valign="top">HD grey space above and bellow portraits distracting.  I liked the fact that the center photo is wider than the two profiles.  My favorite part of the photo is the lighting and shadows.  Shot makes me want to get to know the person behind the shot.  Best score so far at lucky 7.  Good luck.</td>', 'HD grey space above and bellow portraits distracting.  I liked the fact that the center photo is wider than the two profiles.  My favorite part of the photo is the lighting and shadows.  Shot makes me want to get to know the person behind the shot.  Best score so far at lucky 7.  Good luck.', '2010-11-14 22:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222617, 918632, 24511, '<td valign="top">I could have scored a 10 if you hadn''t made the two outer photos twins.  Loved the framing and angle but mostly the story telling style.  I was telling myself a story then boom I was repeating the intro at the right with my head going left to right trying to understand the playback.  I would have prefered the middle photo without the shoulder.  It the character in the right photo awkward looking.  Hey, I just notice the eyes in the right and left photos aren''t the same.  This photo is becoming an itch I can''t scratch as if there is much more hidden facts that elude me.  Center character seems supernatural.  I hate scary movies.  Top score rated so far for making me boil.  Luck 8.</td>', 'I could have scored a 10 if you hadn''t made the two outer photos twins.  Loved the framing and angle but mostly the story telling style.  I was telling myself a story then boom I was repeating the intro at the right with my head going left to right trying to understand the playback.  I would have prefered the middle photo without the shoulder.  It the character in the right photo awkward looking.  Hey, I just notice the eyes in the right and left photos aren''t the same.  This photo is becoming an itch I can''t scratch as if there is much more hidden facts that elude me.  Center character seems supernatural.  I hate scary movies.  Top score rated so far for making me boil.  Luck 8.', '2010-11-14 23:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222621, 918496, 24511, '<td valign="top">Made me think of a deck of cards.  Didnt think of the title theme but loved the eyes looking in three separate directions and the clarity of the captions.  Notice the center frame slightly above the others and at first didn''t enjoy but afterwards liked the blowing petals having their extra space to spin.  Thanks.</td>', 'Made me think of a deck of cards.  Didnt think of the title theme but loved the eyes looking in three separate directions and the clarity of the captions.  Notice the center frame slightly above the others and at first didn''t enjoy but afterwards liked the blowing petals having their extra space to spin.  Thanks.', '2010-11-14 23:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222622, 917968, 24511, '<td valign="top">Great trilogy with action story typical in water sports after a season win.  Future athletes in training no doubt.  Good entry.</td>', 'Great trilogy with action story typical in water sports after a season win.  Future athletes in training no doubt.  Good entry.', '2010-11-14 23:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222623, 918092, 24511, '<td valign="top">Loved everything about this entry except that the two left photos were almost identical.  I would have liked a different action, angle of depth.  I loved the action and brightness.</td>', 'Loved everything about this entry except that the two left photos were almost identical.  I would have liked a different action, angle of depth.  I loved the action and brightness.', '2010-11-14 23:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222626, 918665, 24511, '<td valign="top">My favorite and toppest score of 10.  Awsome story telling and frame color coordination.  You rock into the winners circle in my book.  Adding to favorites.  Go get your ribbon now.</td>', 'My favorite and toppest score of 10.  Awsome story telling and frame color coordination.  You rock into the winners circle in my book.  Adding to favorites.  Go get your ribbon now.', '2010-11-14 23:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222627, 918707, 24511, '<td valign="top">I would have liked the two top photos to be in alternate order and tell the story of smiling, then joking and ending with the laughing scene.  Style reminded me of photo strips taken at the mall in a coin photo machine.  Loved the emotion and positivity of the subjects.  High score for making me smile.  I guess it is contagious...Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I would have liked the two top photos to be in alternate order and tell the story of smiling, then joking and ending with the laughing scene.  Style reminded me of photo strips taken at the mall in a coin photo machine.  Loved the emotion and positivity of the subjects.  High score for making me smile.  I guess it is contagious...Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-11-14 23:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222628, 918738, 24511, '<td valign="top">I noticed that all three captions were the same framing on the subject.  I would have enjoyed a higher scoring with a variety of angles or different action, anything to improve of variety.  I think the the solo photo on the right is a ten on its own with the other two added on when it needed no support.  Good luck.</td>', 'I noticed that all three captions were the same framing on the subject.  I would have enjoyed a higher scoring with a variety of angles or different action, anything to improve of variety.  I think the the solo photo on the right is a ten on its own with the other two added on when it needed no support.  Good luck.', '2010-11-14 23:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222629, 917799, 24511, '<td valign="top">Never been a fan of blank backgrounds but this photo was the first time I noticed this challenge.  I guess your topic is having me look inside and outside of the box.  I loved the different elements of action and depth.  If you like the camera then you must be ok in my book.  Pleasing captions.  I can see story.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Never been a fan of blank backgrounds but this photo was the first time I noticed this challenge.  I guess your topic is having me look inside and outside of the box.  I loved the different elements of action and depth.  If you like the camera then you must be ok in my book.  Pleasing captions.  I can see story.  Thanks for sharing.', '2010-11-14 23:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222634, 918760, 24511, '<td valign="top">Why so serious.  I guess it''s the Evil thing at work.  Interesting theme that has the risk of you being taken for a monkey.  Not happy you used electric tape instead of duck tape though.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Why so serious.  I guess it''s the Evil thing at work.  Interesting theme that has the risk of you being taken for a monkey.  Not happy you used electric tape instead of duck tape though.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-11-14 23:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222635, 918318, 24511, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative.  I would have liked the bottom photo feet to be without any bluring.  Enjoyed the photo even more after reading the title.  Thanks.</td>', 'Very imaginative.  I would have liked the bottom photo feet to be without any bluring.  Enjoyed the photo even more after reading the title.  Thanks.', '2010-11-14 23:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222637, 918680, 24511, '<td valign="top">You are totally nuts.  I love it but in a insane disturbing way.  Go away from my mind forever with this photo.  And if it wins I will have to grin and bear it for even more weeks on the ribbon viewing screne.  Aahhh.  Grrreat entry.</td>', 'You are totally nuts.  I love it but in a insane disturbing way.  Go away from my mind forever with this photo.  And if it wins I will have to grin and bear it for even more weeks on the ribbon viewing screne.  Aahhh.  Grrreat entry.', '2010-11-14 23:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222639, 918471, 24511, '<td valign="top">I scored poorly a previous entry for the lack of variety in captions but I must say this one simple eyes say it all entry grasped at my ribs with love and wow-ness.  Top 10 for me.  Winner of my heart entry.  Thanks</td>', 'I scored poorly a previous entry for the lack of variety in captions but I must say this one simple eyes say it all entry grasped at my ribs with love and wow-ness.  Top 10 for me.  Winner of my heart entry.  Thanks', '2010-11-14 23:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222642, 918507, 24511, '<td valign="top">Most qwirky, shlick and shlacky, upwakingly ferociously untied at the normally symetrical you aint funny photo I''ve ever witnessed this whole challenge.  Loved the black and white decision that gave me a sense of unity among the chaos.  And let me tell you this photo does not need more chaos.  Good luck.</td>', 'Most qwirky, shlick and shlacky, upwakingly ferociously untied at the normally symetrical you aint funny photo I''ve ever witnessed this whole challenge.  Loved the black and white decision that gave me a sense of unity among the chaos.  And let me tell you this photo does not need more chaos.  Good luck.', '2010-11-14 23:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222643, 917780, 24511, '<td valign="top">Your photo gives a whole new meaning to four eyes.  I love most of all the gazing eyes of each character seemingly looking deep into ones soul.  Loved it.  Thanks.</td>', 'Your photo gives a whole new meaning to four eyes.  I love most of all the gazing eyes of each character seemingly looking deep into ones soul.  Loved it.  Thanks.', '2010-11-14 23:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
